# 🔥 2. MAIN ISSUE WE DEBUGGED

## ❌ Problem:

```text
postgres-0 → Pending
```

### Root Cause:

```text
No StorageClass in kubeadm cluster
PVC not bound
```

---

# 🧠 IMPORTANT CONCEPT

| Component    | Purpose            |
| ------------ | ------------------ |
| S3           | Terraform state    |
| DynamoDB     | Locking            |
| EBS          | Kubernetes storage |
| PVC          | Request storage    |
| StorageClass | Provision storage  |

---

# 🔥 3. FAST FIX (OPTION 1 — USED)

## ❌ Removed PVC:

```yaml
volumeClaimTemplates ❌
```

## ✅ Added:

```yaml
volumes:
  - name: postgres-storage
    emptyDir: {}
```

### Result:

```text
postgres → Running ✅
django → Running ✅
```

---

